  "limitations": [
    "Existing seeded demo only. Native POS redirect, Inventory, new-member controls, tier trail, empty wallet lookup and Station Setup are observed. No business save, search, station selection, creation, payment, check-in, SMS, channel action or fixture is attempted.",
    "One real POS sign-in, one held-then-issued Console handoff and one Console exchange are allowed. The native redirect performs arrival; no destination or response is substituted.",
    "The source handoff exchange reuses the same session row. Both origins are explicitly signed out and both /me responses must be 401; branch/preferences fingerprints must match before cleanup.",
    "Signed-in identity, person/record values and input seeds are masked before captures, including late mutations. Only safe hashes/counts and masked native PNGs are retained.",
    "Exact stock record photo URLs learned privately from the own-park stock response are privacy-suppressed in the main Console Inventory frame with a fixed transparent PNG. Original record photos are not fetched or verified.",
    "Request guards prevent all other writes and unknown reads before dispatch. Read-only hashes are observations during this proof, not a lock against other administrators. Write behavior remains automated coverage."
  ],
